  message: "Revised after conversation clarification 2026-04-18: (1) renamed 'productive-failure' → 'no-progress failure' (matches stop_logic.sh vocabulary and stops being semantically backwards); (2) reframed the motivation around 'persistent bug is invisible under the 24h cap' instead of the misleading '3min-vs-24h detection' framing; (3) clarified that the kill switch is time-agnostic — 5 no-progress failures on a chain trips it regardless of spacing; (4) labeled pieces 1-3 as scaffolding vs piece 4 as the actual signal."  # ca92
