  nonce: 164e  # 164e
  message: "Dropped the short-window fast-fire cooldown piece after 2026-04-18 conversation. The kill switch fires on the chain counter in ~5 minutes at 60s poll, which is faster than any plausible short-window trigger would kick in; and a 30-min cooldown is a SHORTER breather than the existing 24h rate limit, so it would allow MORE resource waste per day, not less. The kill switch alone is the real mechanism. Reframed as three pieces (chain-length tracking + no-progress classification + kill switch) with the dropped cooldown documented in 'Explicitly NOT doing' so the reasoning survives."  # 164e
