  message: "Landed in PR #3156 (merged). Three pieces delivered: (1) chain tracking in meta.json with replaces/chain_length/consecutive_no_progress; (2) no-progress failure classification based on pane-byte threshold (512); (3) consecutive-failure kill switch firing at 5 chained no-progress failures, writing supervisor.auto-paused. New 'agent-supervisor resume' subcommand. status output surfaces auto_paused, kill_switch_threshold, and per-session chain state. Docs (docs/agent-supervisor.md) gained a 'Recovering from auto-pause' section. 24 new tests; 71 total pass across both supervisor test files. Short-window cooldown intentionally omitted per Explicitly NOT doing section."  # 64be
